.TH "shadowsun-by-tonic" "6" "2026-11-18" "Shadow Sun User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
shadowsun-by-tonic - the command to run Shadow Sun.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
shadowsun-by-tonic
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shadow Sun is a 4k intro released by tonic in May 2004.
It won the 2nd #demoscene 4k source compo with 72 points.
.PP
It runs in a 640x480 OpenGL window, with music synthesized in real time.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
Escape
Quit the intro.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/results.html
.SH BUGS
.PP
